"Get ready for the ultimate racing experience in Formula X Car Racing 1F Championship! \ud83c\udfce\ufe0f\ud83d\udca8\nStep into the driver\u2019s seat and feel the adrenaline as you speed through challenging tracks, tight corners, and high-speed straights. Master your Formula X car, push your limits, and compete to become the 1F Racing Champion!\nKey Features:\n\u26a1 High-Speed Racing Action: Drift, boost, and overtake like a pro.\n\ud83c\udfc6 1F Championship Mode: Compete in multiple circuits to claim the ultimate title.\n\ud83d\ude97 Customizable Formula Cars: Upgrade engines, tires, and aerodynamics for peak performance.\n\ud83c\udf0d Multiple Tracks & Environments: City streets, mountains, and high-tech racing arenas.\n\ud83c\udfae Arcade & Competitive Gameplay: Perfect for casual fun and hardcore racing fans alike.\n\ud83c\udfa8 Stunning Graphics & Realistic Physics: Feel the speed like never before!\nWhether you\u2019re a casual racer or a professional speedster, Formula X Car Racing 1F Championship delivers heart-pounding excitement at every turn. Are you ready to dominate the track and become a legend?", "short_description": "Race at top speed in Formula X Car Racing 1F Championship \u2013 be the ultimate racing legend!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/horizonsgames-privacy-policy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "HorizonsGames", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/horizonsgames-com/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "673385183287495"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recom